      "start_seconds": 1.0,
      "end_seconds": 5.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "doctor, we're ready in room two, I've already taken the observations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.95,
      "end_seconds": 10.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "thanks, that's helpful hello, please sit what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.88,
      "end_seconds": 15.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I've been feeling flat and slowed down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.4,
      "end_seconds": 19.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.26,
      "end_seconds": 27.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "I take escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 27.8,
      "end_seconds": 32.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.83,
      "end_seconds": 39.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.83,
      "end_seconds": 56.39,
      "duration_seconds": 15.56,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. Lansoprazole. I take it 30 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.62,
      "end_seconds": 75.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.63,
      "end_seconds": 80.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "uh, it's been two days now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.08,
      "end_seconds": 84.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.72,
      "end_seconds": 87.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.08,
      "end_seconds": 93.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 94.06,
      "end_seconds": 101.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.32,
      "end_seconds": 104.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.43,
      "end_seconds": 116.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.46,
      "text": "I mean, I've also had dry skin and hair. Well, I've also had constipation, for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.95,
      "end_seconds": 124.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Have you been feeling flat and slowed down at any time before this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.45,
      "end_seconds": 133.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.43,
      "text": "Let me think, a bit, last year. It It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 135.18,
      "end_seconds": 138.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "yes, that's right, that's how it was"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.11,
      "end_seconds": 157.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any palpitations, weight loss, hearing voices or thoughts of harming myself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.44,
      "end_seconds": 174.4,
      "duration_seconds": 15.96,
      "text": "No, no palpitations, no weight loss, no hearing voices. I did have being cold all the time at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.43,
      "end_seconds": 182.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.83,
      "end_seconds": 186.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "well, no, that's all normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.53,
      "end_seconds": 191.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.96,
      "end_seconds": 196.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.26,
      "end_seconds": 199.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.69,
      "end_seconds": 205.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.46,
      "end_seconds": 209.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.51,
      "end_seconds": 214.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.56,
      "end_seconds": 219.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.57,
      "end_seconds": 234.86,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "I had a reaction to erythromycin when I was younger, bad stomach cramps, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.93,
      "end_seconds": 243.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Right, do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.36,
      "end_seconds": 267.19,
      "duration_seconds": 18.83,
      "text": "I've had anxiety for five years now. Actually, um, I've had acid reflux, yes. I did try to ignore it for a while. I told my wife I'd come today. I have depression, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.84,
      "end_seconds": 275.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Okay, I can see depression in your file as well. Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.7,
      "end_seconds": 284.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "I had a meniscus repair on my knee four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 284.56,
      "end_seconds": 291.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pulse 71, temperature is 36.4 degrees, pressure 111 over 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.8,
      "end_seconds": 293.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.65,
      "end_seconds": 297.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 299.11,
      "end_seconds": 300.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.06,
      "end_seconds": 303.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.75,
      "end_seconds": 323.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Your pulse is slow and your reflexes relax slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.09,
      "end_seconds": 344.39,
      "duration_seconds": 16.3,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Okay, thinking it through, my working impression is an underactive thyroid presenting as low mood. Depression is also on my list. A blood count is what I'd like next, for tiredness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 345.65,
      "end_seconds": 348.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "The earliest is Friday, 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.76,
      "end_seconds": 349.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.09,
      "end_seconds": 356.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "A thyroid test is what I'd like next, for slowing and cold intolerance"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.0,
      "end_seconds": 362.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Uh, where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.22,
      "end_seconds": 376.02,
      "duration_seconds": 11.8,
      "text": "We'll check the thyroid before deciding on any antidepressant. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.17,
      "end_seconds": 380.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.9,
      "end_seconds": 387.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Let's plan a check after the results. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.83,
      "end_seconds": 389.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
